  vendorName: Bookseller Bernard
  offerText: I am offering a massive, leather-bound encyclopedia set. It demands
    a heavy toll on your purse and your shelves, but the knowledge inside will greatly
    enrich your mind.
  acceptResultText: You stack the heavy books on your shelf. You open one, only to
    realize the pages are completely blank. It was a total scam.
  rejectResultText: You send the salesman away. Feeling inspired to declutter, you
    actually gather some old magazines and sell them to a neighbor!
